    "chunk_text": "e becym\u00fe & \u00fe\u00e6s heahstan miht \u00fee ofersceada\u00f0, & & nu Elizabeth \u00fein m\u00e6ge sunu on hyre ylde geeacnode, & \u00fee mona\u00f0 ys hyre sixta, seo is unberende \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe Maria, her is Drihtnes \u00feinen, gewur\u00fee me \u00e6fter \u00feinum worde; & se engel hyre fram gewat. So\u00felice on \u00feam dagum aras Maria & ferde on muntland mid ofste, on Iudeisce ceastre & eode into \u00d0a w\u00e6s geworden \u00fea Elizabeth gehyrde Marian gretinge, \u00fea gefagnude \u00fe\u00e6t cild on hyre inno\u00f0e, And & heo clypode micelre stefne & cw\u00e6\u00fe; \u00f0u eart betwux wifum gebletsod, & gebletsud ys \u00feines Sona swa \u00feinre gretinge stefn on minum earum geworden w\u00e6s, \u00fea fahnude min cild on minum And eadig \u00feu eart \u00f0u \u00fee gelyfdest \u00fe\u00e6t fulfremede synd, \u00fea \u00f0ing \u00fee \u00f0e fram Drihtne ges\u00e6de synd. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Maria, min sawl m\u00e6rsa\u00fe Drihten; And min gast geblissude on Gode minum H\u00e6lende, So\u00felice heonunfor\u00f0 me eadige secga\u00f0 ealle cneoressa, for\u00f0am \u00fee me micele \u00feing dyde se \u00f0e mihtig He worhte m\u00e6gne on hys earme, he tod\u00e6lde \u00fea ofermodan, on mode hyra heortan. He awearp \u00fea rican of setle, & \u00f0a ea\u00f0modan up ahof. Hingriende he mid godum gefylde, & ofermode idele forlet. He afeng Israhel hys cniht, & gemunde hys mildheortnesse. Swa he spr\u00e6c to ur",
